    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Jump</strong> is the love baby of a game jam idea and my long dream to make learning about AI more approachable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you can either: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >master the dragon jump and compete on the leaderboard for the best time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >connect via an external script and train your own AI to beat all those sweaty tryhards </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed as a single player, single input precision platformer. Your task? Get to the portal AS-FAST-AS-YOU-CAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too easy? Don't worry I'm working on a lot of traps that would fix that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too hard? Git gud and learn how to program an AI to get you past the level you're struggling with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Jump</strong> is the love baby of a game jam idea and my long dream to make learning about AI more approachable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you can either: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >master the dragon jump and compete on the leaderboard for the best time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >connect via an external script and train your own AI to beat all those sweaty tryhards </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed as a single player, single input precision platformer. Your task? Get to the portal AS-FAST-AS-YOU-CAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too easy? Don't worry I'm working on a lot of traps that would fix that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too hard? Git gud and learn how to program an AI to get you past the level you're struggling with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
